### Orchestration - happy path
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orchestration/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-001", "productCode": "LAPTOP-001", "quantity": 1, "amount": 1500.00, "shippingCity": "Jakarta"}

### Orchestration - payment declined (amount > 5000)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orchestration/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-001", "productCode": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 1, "amount": 9000.00, "shippingCity": "Bandung"}

### Orchestration - inventory fails -> refund payment, cancel order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orchestration/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-001", "productCode": "CONSOLE-001", "quantity": 1, "amount": 499.00, "shippingCity": "Surabaya"}

### Orchestration - shipping fails -> release stock, refund payment, cancel order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orchestration/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-001", "productCode": "MOUSE-001", "quantity": 2, "amount": 50.00, "shippingCity": "Atlantis"}

### Orchestration - saga history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orchestration/sagas

### Choreography - happy path (202 Accepted, PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/choreography/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-002", "productCode": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 1, "amount": 800.00, "shippingCity": "Bandung"}

### Choreography - inventory fails
POST http://localhost:8080/api/choreography/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-002", "productCode": "CONSOLE-001", "quantity": 1, "amount": 499.00, "shippingCity": "Jakarta"}

### Choreography - shipping fails
POST http://localhost:8080/api/choreography/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "CUST-002", "productCode": "MOUSE-001", "quantity": 3, "amount": 75.00, "shippingCity": "Gotham"}

### Orders (eventually consistent for choreography)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Payments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payments

### Inventory
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/products

### Stock reservations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/reservations

### Shipments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipments
